        "type": "modonomicon:none"
      },
      "show_title_separator": true,
      "text": "[#](53341a)This family contains **2 distinct workings**. Each one has its own exact offerings, circles, power, and conditions; use the card belonging to the result you intend.[#]()",
      "title": "Rite of Fertility",
      "use_markdown_in_title": false
    },
    {
      "type": "modonomicon:text",
      "anchor": "",
      "condition": {
        "type": "modonomicon:none"
      },
      "show_title_separator": true,
      "text": "[#](53341a)The working begins at radius 4 and advances one block every five ticks, ending at radius 50 plus 2 blocks per nearby Coven witch. Each passing ring grows the land, restores Zombie Villagers, and clears Blindness, Nausea, and Poison from players.[#]()",
      "title": "How It Unfolds",
      "use_markdown_in_title": false
    },
    {
      "type": "modonomicon:text",
      "anchor": "",
      "condition": {
        "type": "modonomicon:none"
      },
      "show_title_separator": false,
      "text": "[#](53341a)An active cat familiar also grants Regeneration II and Health Boost. The rite pauses while its caster or chunks are unavailable; breaking its sustaining circle aborts it and returns the consumed offerings.[#]()",
      "title": " ",
      "use_markdown_in_title": false
    },
    {
      "type": "modonomicon:text",
      "anchor": "",
      "condition": {
        "type": "modonomicon:none"
      },
      "show_title_separator": true,
      "text": "[#](53341a)Makes nearby land fertile. Heals sick villagers.[#]() [#](53341a)**Required offerings:** **Bone Meal**, **Hint of Rebirth**, **Diamond Vapor**, **Quicklime**, **Gypsum**, **Mutandis**.[#]()",
      "title": "Altar-powered fertility",
      "use_markdown_in_title": false
    },
